      "name": "Muddy Beginnings",
      "subtitle": "Dig, build, and put the gold somewhere safe.",
      "briefing": "A tidy band of knights is coming to sweep your new home. Dig out a bit of space, build a Treasury, and be ready before they arrive.",
      "map": [
        "##############################",
        "##############################",
        "##.........................###",
        "##....g....................###",
